{"work_id": "MX4-033", "matched_key": "评西北大捷兼论解放军的新式整军运动", "normalized_offset": 0, "normalized_context": "评西北大捷兼论解放军的新式整军运动1293很弱而且极大部分分任守备胡军以外还有邓宝珊两个旅防守榆林宁夏马鸿逵和青海马步芳的九个旅分布在三边和陇东以上胡邓马各部全部正规军包括过去被歼一次至两次但又补充起来的部队在内目前总共三十四个旅以上是就西北敌军态势而言再说所谓丁字形交通线上受我军打击较少的五个旅其中两个旅困守延安三个旅在大关中其他多数是新补充的部队少数是受过歼灭性打击的部队这就是说整个大关中特别是甘肃方面敌军异常空虚无法阻止人民解放军的攻势这种形势势必牵动蒋军在南线的一部分部署首先是牵动", "cue_words": ["补充"], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-980973716441b9197629", "source_url": "https://ebook.dswxyjy.org.cn/dswxbooks/storage/files/20220801/36e607c0457c68b8f6cca39f64231ccb9989/mobile/javascript/search_config.js", "raw_sha256": "c4ad80b15f7c7bde2dac26caec6024460d6775ac4c04a8a0c17b3dc6f45c201c", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-official", "volume": 4, "basis": "official_book_landing_and_reader_configuration"}], "kind": "reader_page", "number": 183, "end": 183, "record_path": "archive/records/A-980973716441b9197629.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-980973716441b9197629.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东选集（第四卷）〔官方阅读器全文文字层〕", "source_media": "official_page_text", "source_layer": "official_reader_text", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-f214f86a8eccd755", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
{"work_id": "MX4-033", "matched_key": "评西北大捷兼论解放军的新式整军运动", "normalized_offset": 0, "normalized_context": "评西北大捷兼论解放军的新式整军运动1295市政策坚决地保护和发展民族工商业的方针相结合这样就必然会使人民解放军的威力无敌于天下任凭蒋介石匪帮及其主子美国帝国主义在中国人民民主革命的伟大斗争面前如何拚命挣扎胜利总是属于我们的注释1后调旅指国民党军队中那些在战场上被人民解放军大部歼灭后其残余部分调到后方补充而不改变番号的旅2晋冀鲁豫野战军司令员刘伯承政治委员邓小平指挥的六个纵队于一九四七年六月三十日起强渡黄河向大别山进军从而揭开了人民解放军战略进攻的序幕先后建立了鄂豫皖西桐柏江汉等根据地华东野", "cue_words": ["补充"], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-980973716441b9197629", "source_url": "https://ebook.dswxyjy.org.cn/dswxbooks/storage/files/20220801/36e607c0457c68b8f6cca39f64231ccb9989/mobile/javascript/search_config.js", "raw_sha256": "c4ad80b15f7c7bde2dac26caec6024460d6775ac4c04a8a0c17b3dc6f45c201c", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-official", "volume": 4, "basis": "official_book_landing_and_reader_configuration"}], "kind": "reader_page", "number": 185, "end": 185, "record_path": "archive/records/A-980973716441b9197629.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-980973716441b9197629.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东选集（第四卷）〔官方阅读器全文文字层〕", "source_media": "official_page_text", "source_layer": "official_reader_text", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-c3482ab1824cd29b", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
{"work_id": "MX4-033", "matched_key": "评西北大捷兼论解放军的新式整军运动", "normalized_offset": 0, "normalized_context": "评西北大捷兼论解放军的新式整军运动一九四八年三月七日中文马克思主义文库毛泽东评西北大捷兼论解放军的新式整军运动一九四八年三月七日这是毛泽东为中国人民解放军总部发言人起草的评论这时西北战场国民党军的进攻已被粉碎人民解放军已经转入进攻这篇评论分析了西北战场的形势也扼要地介绍了全国其它战场的概况这篇评论的更重要方面是在着重地说明了用诉苦和三查方法进行的新式整军运动的伟大意义这个新式整军运动是人民解放军政治工作和民主运动的一个重要发展是当时全解放区轰轰烈烈的土地改革运动和整党运动在军队中的反映这个", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-533d4eb3d2e77da10b44", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/marxist.org-chinese-mao-19480307.htm", "raw_sha256": "3ad5567ef79c9dd2f00530746ecb947cfabf668990f453c5ab5e40809f34fa59", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-mia-catalogue", "volume": 4, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end": 43, "record_path": "archive/records/A-533d4eb3d2e77da10b44.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-533d4eb3d2e77da10b44.txt", "source_title": "评西北大捷兼论解放军的新式整军运动", "source_media": "html", "source_layer": "web_transcription", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-ab32636e4d6aaa69", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
